      "control_name": "Model Package Must Be Approved Before Deployment",
      "control_description": "A SageMaker model package group's latest version must have ModelApprovalStatus set to Approved. Deploying a model that is PendingManualApproval or Rejected bypasses the change-control gate — the model enters production without human review of its training data, evaluation metrics, or intended use.\n",
